### Taskflow phase 4 smoke test (VS Code REST Client)
### Prereqs: server on :4000, Mongo up, users A and B registered + email-verified.
### Cookies are stored per host by the REST Client, so re-run "Login" to switch users.

@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### 0a. Login as A
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "a@example.com", "password": "secret123" }

### 0b. Login as B (re-run this to act as B; re-run 0a to switch back)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "b@example.com", "password": "secret123" }

### 1. Create org (A)
POST {{base}}/orgs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Smoke Org" }

### 2. Create project (A) — paste orgId from 1
POST {{base}}/orgs/ORG_ID/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Smoke Project" }

### 3. Create task (A) — paste projectId from 2
POST {{base}}/projects/PROJECT_ID/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Comment me", "priority": "med" }

### 4. Comment (A) — paste taskId from 3
POST {{base}}/tasks/TASK_ID/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "First comment" }

### 5. List comments (A) — expect { comments: [ ... ] }, oldest first
GET {{base}}/tasks/TASK_ID/comments?page=1&limit=20

### 6. Move the task (A) — legal
PUT {{base}}/tasks/TASK_ID/move
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "doing" }

### 7. Skip move (A) — expect 400 Illegal status move: doing -> todo? (use done -> todo instead)
PUT {{base}}/tasks/TASK_ID/move
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "todo" }

### 8. Activity (A) — expect newest first: moved, commented, created (3 rows)
GET {{base}}/tasks/TASK_ID/activity?page=1&limit=20

### 9. Assign (A) to B's userId — expect an "assigned" row appended
PUT {{base}}/tasks/TASK_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assigneeId": "USER_B_ID" }

### 10. Unassign (A) — expect detail "unassigned" and the field really gone
PUT {{base}}/tasks/TASK_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assigneeId": null }

### 11. Assign to a non-member — expect 400 "Assignee is not an org member"
PUT {{base}}/tasks/TASK_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assigneeId": "SOMEONE_ELSE_ID" }

### 12. As B (non-member): read A's comments — expect 404
GET {{base}}/tasks/TASK_ID/comments

### 13. As B: read A's activity — expect 404
GET {{base}}/tasks/TASK_ID/activity

### 14. As B: delete A's comment — expect 404
DELETE {{base}}/comments/COMMENT_ID

### 15. As A but non-author (make a second member comment first): expect 403
###     1) login as B, 2) POST a comment, 3) login as A, 4) delete B's comment
DELETE {{base}}/comments/COMMENT_ID

### 16. Delete own comment (author) — expect 200
DELETE {{base}}/comments/COMMENT_ID

### 17. Delete task (A) — expect 200; then 4 and 8 must 404 and Mongo must have no
###     comments/activity rows for that taskId
DELETE {{base}}/tasks/TASK_ID
